description:
Implement a `useLongPress` hook that calls `callback` only if the user holds down a mouse button or touch for at least `delay` ms (default 500). Releasing early cancels the timer. Return an object of event handlers to spread onto the target element.

**Example:**
```tsx
const handlers = useLongPress(() => openContextMenu(), 600);
return <button {...handlers}>Hold me</button>;
```

